- Days to Expiration
- **Call columns:** Price, Intrinsic Value, Delta, Gamma, Theta
- **Strike** (30.00 throughout)
- **Put columns:** Theta, Gamma, Delta, Intrinsic Value, Price

**Sample data rows:**
| Date      | MSFT  | Change | DTE | Call Price | Delta | Gamma  | Theta  | Put Price |
|-----------|-------|--------|-----|-----------|-------|--------|--------|-----------|
