| 2-Aug-07  | 29.52 | +0.22  | 76  | 1.14      | 0.00  | 47.88  | 0.124  | 1.44      |
| 3-Aug-07  | 28.96 | -0.56  | 75  | 0.90      | 0.00  | 41.04  | 0.122  | 1.80      |
