Two bullish periods in the test window:
- Period 1: 1/3/2000 to 11/3/2000
- Period 2: 8/8/2003 to 9/21/2007

**Table 13-5: Select Sector SPDR Portfolio Tilt Results**

|                      | Period 1  | Period 2  | SPY 1    | SPY 2    |
